        "id": 17661,
        "title": "setInterval ve clearInterval",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 149767,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>setInterval()</code>, kodu asenkron olarak çalıştıran başka bir yerel JavaScript metodudur.</p><p><code>setInterval</code> ile oyun döngüsünün küçük bir bölümünü belirli zaman aralıklarında çalıştırabiliriz. Bu metot hakkında daha fazla bilgi edinelim.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 149768,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>setInterval()</code> bir callback fonksiyonunu ve bir aralığı parametre olarak alır. Burada <code>toggleInvincibility</code>, oyuncunun yenilmezliğini açıp kapatır.</p><p><code>setInterval</code> çağrısına callback fonksiyonunu ve aralığı geçir.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"217\" endIndex=\"228\" /><option startIndex=\"229\" endIndex=\"248\" /><option startIndex=\"250\" endIndex=\"253\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isInvincible = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" toggleInvincibility = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (isInvincible) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Invincibility off&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  isInvincible = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Invincibility on&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  isInvincible = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"setInterval(toggleInvincibility, \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>setInterval</code>, ardından <code>toggleInvincibility</code> ve son olarak <code>500</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 149769,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>setInterval</code>, ikinci parametre olarak ilettiğimiz belirtilen milisaniye sayısı kadar gecikmeyle callback fonksiyonunu sonsuza dek çalıştırır.</p><p>Callback'in ilk çalıştırılması, belirtilen sürenin ardından gerçekleşir. Hemen çalıştırılmaz.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"250\" endIndex=\"253\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isInvincible = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" toggleInvincibility = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (isInvincible) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Invincibility off&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  isInvincible = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Invincibility on&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  isInvincible = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"setInterval(toggleInvincibility, \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>500</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 149770,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kodu çalıştırırsak <code>setInterval</code> için bir durdurma olmadığı için zaman aşımı hatası alabiliriz.</p><p>Güçlendiricinin her <code>500</code> milisaniyede bir sonsuza kadar yanıp sönmesini görmek için buraya <code>500</code> milisaniye ekle!</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"215\" endIndex=\"218\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isPowerUpVisible = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"setInterval(\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (isPowerUpVisible) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Power-up hidden&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  isPowerUpVisible = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Power-up visible&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  isPowerUpVisible = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}, \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>500</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 149771,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>setInterval()</code>'ın süresiz çalışmasını durdurmak için <code>clearInterval</code> metodunu kullanabiliriz.<br /></p><p><code>setInterval</code> değerini <code>powerUpBlinkInterval</code> değişkenine kaydedebiliriz. Ardından, <code>2500</code> milisaniye sonra çalıştırılmak üzere bir <code>setTimeout</code> içinde <code>clearInterval(powerUpBlinkInterval)</code> kullan.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"268\" endIndex=\"281\" /><option startIndex=\"282\" endIndex=\"302\" /><option startIndex=\"340\" endIndex=\"344\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isPowerUpVisible = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" powerUpBlinkInterval = setInterval(\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (isPowerUpVisible) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Power-up hidden&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  isPowerUpVisible = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Power-up visible&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  isPowerUpVisible = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}, \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"setTimeout(\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" clearInterval(powerUpBlinkInterval);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Power-up ended&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}, \" /><text value=\"2500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>let</code>, ardından <code>powerUpBlinkInterval</code> ve sonra <code>clearInterval</code>, <code>powerUpBlinkInterval</code>, <code>2500</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 149772,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>clearInterval()</code> metodu, tek parametresi olarak <code>powerUpBlinkInterval</code>'ı alır.</p><p>Çalıştırıldığında, <code>setInterval()</code> metodunun tekrarlanan eylemini durdurur.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"268\" endIndex=\"281\" /><option startIndex=\"282\" endIndex=\"302\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isPowerUpVisible = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" powerUpBlinkInterval = setInterval(\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (isPowerUpVisible) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Power-up hidden&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  isPowerUpVisible = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Power-up visible&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  isPowerUpVisible = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}, \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"setTimeout(\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" clearInterval(powerUpBlinkInterval);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Power-up ended&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}, \" /><text value=\"2500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>clearInterval</code>, ardından <code>powerUpBlinkInterval</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
